{"id":"0a8c770817bc3365","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-substitution-closure.md","title":"GL及临时假设推导的一致代入封闭性","display":"thm-gl-substitution-closure — GL及临时假设推导的一致代入封闭性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-substitution-closure","aliases":["72-thm-gl-substitution-closure"],"display":"thm-gl-substitution-closure — GL及临时假设推导的一致代入封闭性","depends_on":["[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §2, print477–480/PDF489–492; local Hilbert-stage induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-substitution-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-substitution-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-substitution-closure — GL及临时假设推导的一致代入封闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §2, print477–480/PDF489–492; local Hilbert-stage induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GL},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{GL},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\sigma_m\">\\(\\sigma,\\sigma_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\\)</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_m[\\Gamma]:=\\{\\sigma_m(B):B\\in\\Gamma\\}\">\\(\\sigma_m[\\Gamma]:=\\{\\sigma_m(B):B\\in\\Gamma\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\sigma_m(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\sigma_m(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\sigma_m[\\Gamma]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\sigma_m(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\sigma_m[\\Gamma]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\sigma_m(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对GL生成阶段归纳。K和Löb图式在代入后仍为同一图式；命题重言式保持，因为可把各命题原子及方框原子的替换结果在任意布尔赋值下的值拉回为原骨架的赋值。MP与必然化都与代入交换，故第一式。再对临时假设的MP闭包阶段归纳，逻辑定理由第一式处理，假设由像集合处理，MP直接保持。全程没有对临时假设增加必然化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{GL},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]；$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A$ 取 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{GL},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]；$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A$ 取 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\sigma_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]，$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m$ 有限；$\\sigma_m[\\Gamma]:=\\{\\sigma_m(B):B\\in\\Gamma\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{GL},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\sigma_m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_m[\\Gamma]:=\\{\\sigma_m(B):B\\in\\Gamma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\sigma_m(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\sigma_m[\\Gamma]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\sigma_m(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1831,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-373","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-substitution-closure|thm-gl-substitution-closure — GL及临时假设推导的一致代入封闭性]]"}],"outgoing":["3fd94ba56d864509","50496a022b75cf4f","2b98f8844a547104"]}